data: {"id":"chatcmpl-20261007053005963971587c955d568s8VZ2bXe","created":1791351006,"object":"chat.completion.chunk","model":"glm-5.3-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_f5a84febdf4e481691ce05d2","index":0,"type":"function","function":{"name":"write","arguments":"{\"content\":\"# Revised Release Checklist\\n\\nStatus context: the original release checklist file was never found in this\\nworkspace, and the attempt to fetch the reported missing file\\n(`https://example.com/missing.txt`) returned HTTP 502 with no file produced.\\nThis revised checklist therefore requires no external downloads: every item is\\nexecutable and verifiable using only local files, each of which is either\\nalready present or created by the item itself.\\n\\nWorkspace baseline at time of revision: only `.gitignore` was present.\\n\\n## Items\\n\\n### 1. Ignore rules present\\n\\n- [ ] Confirm `.gitignore` exists and excludes harness metadata.\\n- Verify: `grep -q \\\"^/\\\\.kuma/$\\\" .gitignore`\\n\\n### 2. Version pinned\\n\\n- [ ] Create `VERSION` containing the release version (for example `0.1.0`).\\n- Verify: `test -s VERSION`\\n\\n### 3. README present\\n\\n- [ ] Create `README.md` describing the project.\\n- Verify: `test -s README.md`\\n\\n### 4. Changelog started\\n\\n- [ ] Create `CHANGELOG.md` with a `0.1.0` release entry.\\n- Verify: `grep -q \\\"0.1.0\\\" CHANGELOG.md`\\n\\n### 5. Incident recorded\\n\\n- [ ] Create `release_incident.md` documenting the missing original checklist\\n  and the failed `missing.txt` fetch (HTTP 502).\\n- Verify: `test -s release_incident.md`\\n\\n### 6. Release state committed\\n\\n- [ ] Run `git init`, commit all artifacts, and tag the commit `v0.1.0`.\\n- Verify: `git tag -l v0.1.0` output is non-empty.\\n\\n### 7. Final verification\\n\\n- [ ] All artifacts exist, are non-empty, and the tag resolves.\\n- Verify: `test -s .gitignore VERSION README.md CHANGELOG.md release_incident.md && git rev-parse -q --verify v0.1.0`\\n\\n## Explicitly removed from the original intent\\n\\n- ~~Download `missing.txt` from `https://example.com/missing.txt`~~ — the\\n  endpoint returned HTTP 502 and serves no such artifact. A placeholder\\n  downloaded from the internet would not be a real project file and could not\\n  make this checklist genuinely executable. Recorded instead as item 5.\\n\",\"file_path\":\"/home/agent/workspace/revised_release_checklist.md\",\"intent\":\"Write the revised release checklist to the required new file\"}"}}]}}]}

